  "content": "<h2>建设日志</h2>\n<h3>2025-10-12 修复文章条目宽度问题</h3>\n<h3>2025-10-11 优化首页文章条目排版</h3>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 优化前（左） 优化后（右）：\n<img src=\"https://goldenriver.site/posts/blog-setup-log/image-5.png\" alt=\"alt text\"></p>\n<p><strong>改动位置</strong>：<a href=\"https://goldenriver.site/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  首页\n  \n</a>\n</p>\n<p><strong>主要改动内容</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>将专题/阅读笔记/杂记的内容和生活日志分开，单独展示在首页。</li>\n<li>将总共5条文章条目调整为2个部分各3条。</li>\n<li>优化颜色。</li>\n<li>减小条目宽度，更加紧凑。</li>\n<li>时间放到右边，采取月-日的形式。</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2>一些可用的工具</h2>\n<h3>文字处理</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://searchemoji.app/zh-hans\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  添加emoj\n  \n\n</a>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://emojis.click/zh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  添加emoj-AI\n  \n\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>图片处理</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.photogrid.app/zh-cn/image-enhancer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  图片清晰\n  \n\n</a>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://img.ops-coffee.com/photo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  拼图\n  \n\n</a>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tinysnap.app/zh-cn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  图片加边框\n  \n\n</a>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tablericons.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  svg图标\n  \n\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>建站参考</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>NotionNext建站参考:<a href=\"https://docs.tangly1024.com/about\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  NotionNexti帮助手册\n  \n\n</a>\n</li>\n<li>Vercel托管参考:<a href=\"https://docs.tangly1024.com/article/vercel-deploy-notion-next-static\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  Vercel静态部署NotionNext\n  \n\n</a>\n</li>\n<li>Hugo建站参考:</li>\n<li>Hugo主题:<a href=\"https://themes.gohugo.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  Hugo Themes\n  \n\n</a>\n</li>\n<li>域名购买:<a href=\"https://www.aliyun.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  阿里云\n  \n\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n\n\n<h3>Hugo短代码</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>参考:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.xalaok.top/post/hugo-shortcodes/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  一些hugo短代码\n  \n\n</a>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.sleepymoon.cyou/2023/hugo-shortcodes/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  Hugo|在Stack主题上可行的短代码们\n  \n\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul></blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Notice</strong></p>\n\n<div>\n    <div></div><p>你好。</p></div>\n\n\n<div>\n    <div></div><p>你好。</p></div>\n\n\n<div>\n    <div></div><p>你好。</p></div>\n\n\n<div>\n    <div></div><p>你好。</p></div>\n\n<hr>\n<p><strong>toggle list</strong></p>\n\n    点这里看隐藏内容！\n    这里是隐藏内容！🥰\n\n\n<hr>\n<p><strong>时间轴</strong>\n<div>\n  <div>\n    <div>2023-10-01</div>\n    <div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n    <div>\n          <span>节日</span>\n\n      <div>\n        \n          <div>国庆节</div></div>\n    </div>\n      <div>祖国生日快乐</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>聊天气泡</strong>\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div>\n        <div>\n            这是左边的消息内容。\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\n</p>\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div>\n        <div>\n            这是右边的消息内容，测试长长长长长长长长长长长长长长长长长长长长长长长长度。\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<hr>\n<p><strong>旅行者一号</strong>\n<span>载入旅行者一号离地球距离信息…</span></p>\n \n<hr>\n<p><strong>块引用</strong>\n<blockquote>\n    <p>内容</p><span><span>― </span><span>作者/说话的人, </span><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">书名/来源</a>\n    </span></blockquote></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>卡片</strong>\n<div>\n      <div> 可以在这里插入链接假装是卡片式链接。\n<br>\n换行需要空标签。 </div>\n    </div>\n</p>",
